At this stage of your theory, I would probably recommend not using IRT due to its computational complexity. You might want to try a SEM (e..g, via lavaan) approach first to determine what approximately works well, and make decisions from there. It's possible to go about these analyses using IRT, but the estimation times will be noticeably large and likely less flexible than more developed alternatives. HTH.

Phil

